```Title: File Written to the Startup Folder from the Command Line (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1547.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 61cd67b8-a2e4-425c-b46b-4174fa9cd1da```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Login scripts and installers that place shortcuts in the Startup folder```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image IN ("*\\cmd.exe", "*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe", "*\\wscript.exe", "*\\cscript.exe", "*\\xcopy.exe", "*\\robocopy.exe", "*\\certutil.exe", "*\\bitsadmin.exe", "*\\curl.exe") CommandLine="*\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup*")
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
